  unitName: Leo of Indifference (EU)
  unitId: 710186
  unitNumber: 7140
  description: "The Corruption of Yggdrasil, blind and devouring all in its path,
    spread from world to world, from epoch to epoch, up to the lion\u2019s portal,
    touching even two legendary warrior women who were caught in an apparently endless
    battle. One of them wakes, centuries later, her back set with eight blades, remembering
    nothing but her name and her new mission. The Corruption must continue to spread."
  summonDesc: My return to the living only heralds death.
  fusionDesc: The flames of the Corruption will spread to every soul.
